r developing winning patterns. Keeping the Bamboo concentration (T2-T3-T3-T3-T4-T5-T5) gives me the best chance for forming multiple chows and potentially Half Flush or All Chows patterns. The W4 pair and remaining Dots tiles can support the hand structure.\n\nAnswer: Play B2"}
